# Incremental Git Checkpoints

Follow the Git checkpoint policy in AGENTS.md.

During implementation:
- Commit after every validated milestone.
- Do not wait until the end of the task.
- Continue autonomously after successful commits.
- Preserve user changes and worktree isolation.
- Never push without authorization.

Git checkpoints do not replace the final `just ci` quality gate.
